    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "Every positive cutoff-18 double-accident summand supplies a normalized four-generator cyclotomic ideal coupling a low-distance product star, two distinct nonidentity quotient lifts, and equality of their product and quotient targets at one degree-one row-prime ideal. The row prime divides the joint ideal norm, which is bounded by the normalized low-distance principal norms. Primes outside the resulting finite fixed-order candidate set have Y_18=0 and satisfy C36'.",
